5e. La nube del fundente como canal con su propia constante de tiempo
====================================================================================================
  nube 30 g/mol a 2000 K (ρ=0.183), G=2.50 mg/s: caudal 0.82 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 1.97 ms -> f_c = 81 Hz
  nube 30 g/mol a 2000 K (ρ=0.183), G=6.67 mg/s: caudal 2.19 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 0.74 ms -> f_c = 215 Hz
  nube 30 g/mol a 2000 K (ρ=0.183), G=12.50 mg/s: caudal 4.10 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 0.39 ms -> f_c = 403 Hz
  nube 30 g/mol a 3000 K (ρ=0.122), G=2.50 mg/s: caudal 1.23 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 1.32 ms -> f_c = 121 Hz
  nube 30 g/mol a 3000 K (ρ=0.122), G=6.67 mg/s: caudal 3.28 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 0.49 ms -> f_c = 322 Hz
  nube 30 g/mol a 3000 K (ρ=0.122), G=12.50 mg/s: caudal 6.15 L/min caliente, τ_nube = 0.26 ms -> f_c = 604 Hz
  regla: f_pulso >> f_c -> la nube promedia (importa <I^1.5>); f_pulso << f_c -> la nube 'respira' (aire en cada pico)

